================================================================
 platform-enable-msm — wire up drivers/platform/msm/ + X00TD DTS
================================================================

 Three small additions to vanilla mainline 6.19:
   drivers/platform/Kconfig   — add 'source "drivers/platform/msm/Kconfig"'
   drivers/platform/Makefile  — add 'obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM) += msm/'
   arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile — add 'sdm636-asus-x00td.dtb' to dtb-y

 Without these, the kernel build system never descends into the
 drivers/platform/msm/ subdirectory we ship in vendor-baseline-4.19/
 (so the IPA driver, BAM/SPS framework, and Kconfig options all stay
 invisible), and the X00TD device tree blob is never compiled.

 The drivers/platform/msm/Kconfig + Makefile, the sdm636-asus-x00td.dts,
 and the X00TD_defconfig are all NEW files shipped in
 vendor-baseline-4.19/.

 Standalone patch, applies to vanilla mainline 6.19.

================================================================

--- a/drivers/platform/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/platform/Kconfig
@@ -23,3 +23,4 @@
 
 source "drivers/platform/wmi/Kconfig"
 
+source "drivers/platform/msm/Kconfig"
--- a/drivers/platform/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/platform/Makefile
@@ -15,3 +15,4 @@
 obj-$(CONFIG_ARM64_PLATFORM_DEVICES)	+= arm64/
 obj-$(CONFIG_BCM2835_VCHIQ)	+= raspberrypi/
 obj-$(CONFIG_ACPI_WMI)		+= wmi/
+obj-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM) += msm/
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -244,6 +244,7 @@
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm630-sony-xperia-nile-voyager.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm632-fairphone-fp3.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm632-motorola-ocean.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm636-asus-x00td.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm636-bbry-luna-boe.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm636-bbry-luna-syna.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sdm636-motorola-beckham.dtb
